  "type": "MCQ",
  "question": "The sides of a triangle are given by $\\sqrt{b^2+c^2}$, $\\sqrt{c^2+a^2}$ and $\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$, where $a,b,c$ are positive. Then the area of the triangle equals",
